{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaSL6ez65eqv7AcosWXy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I proved `myLen_replicate` in `Main.lean`, and `lean Main.lean` now runs with no errors or warnings.\n\nThe proof uses induction on `n`:\n\n```lean\ntheorem myLen_replicate (n : Nat) (a : α) : myLen (List.replicate n a) = n := by\n  induction n with\n  | zero => rfl\n  | succ k ih => simp [List.replicate, myLen, ih]\n```\n\n- **Base case (`n = 0`):** `List.replicate 0 a` is `[]`, and `myLen [] = 0`, so `rfl` closes it.\n- **Inductive step (`n = k + 1`):** `List.replicate (k+1) a` unfolds to `a :: List.replicate k a`. `myLen` turns that into `myLen (List.replicate k a) + 1`, and the induction hypothesis rewrites it to `k + 1`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":437,"cache_read_input_tokens":7861,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":437},"output_tokens":297,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d63b188c-0279-4560-a343-4e8af13175a8","uuid":"f57f7442-c2b7-4527-9237-4b183eba51cf","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:01:41.500Z","request_id":"req_011CgaSL6KeXY8UFuYMt7wVX"}
